      }
    ],
    "expectedResult": "The answer begins with one dependency-ready model call for a specific Rain Station beat, including reference roles, exact admitted operation, ready input, direct artifact, observable acceptance and downstream transition. Later dependent calls stay compact and blocked until the upstream result is selected.",
